= New conceptual vocabulary that can be transmitted.
CARTOGRAPHER + WITNESS
= Evidence-grounded representations of hidden systems.
GARDENER + STEWARD
= Long-term cultivation without sacrificing system resilience.
CONNECTOR + CONDUCTOR
= Voluntary coordination among complementary participants.
EXPLORER + EMERGENCE CATALYST
= Structured environments for useful discovery.
